# Run All ######################################################$
$
  [+] User                 Configured Nothing asked$
  [+] Firewall             Configured Nothing asked$
  [ ] SSH Login            Partial Nothing asked$
  [+] SSH Auth             Configured Nothing asked$
  [ ] SSH Port             Not Configured Already as asked$
  [+] AppArmor             Configured Status only$
  [+] Auto Updates         Configured Nothing asked$
  [-] DNS                  Not Applicable Nothing asked$
  [+] Backups              Configured Used, not changed$
  [ ] Environment          Not Configured Nothing asked$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Apply all            Nothing to change$
                           [-] Unavailable$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0 or q]:$
$
